 A small TypeScript library, with no runtime dependency, of building blocks for our services that store,
 exchange and update JSON: configuration files, API payloads and stored records. It is imported by the
 other projects of the team, so its behaviour must follow the published standards it implements.
+
+## API
+
+- `resolvePointer(document, pointer)` — JSON Pointer (RFC 6901). Returns the value `pointer` refers to
+  (`""` is the whole document). Throws `JsonPointerError` if the pointer is invalid or does not resolve
+  (missing member, out-of-range or malformed array index, `-`). Only own properties are followed; the
+  document is never modified.
